{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Vu2MWpzqVhxgjDQ6x19iwP","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines rating scale criteria\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Call for Papers — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/call-for-papers\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965321/\"},{\"title\":\"Best Reviewers Award for 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10957073/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965318/\"},{\"title\":\"2023 Reviewer Index\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10791903/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page. However, the search result shows general reviewer guidance rather than a specific rating scale. Let me search for more specific information about the rating scale.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Call for Papers — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/call-for-papers\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/\"},{\"title\":\"Detailed Program — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/detailed-program\"},{\"title\":\"Explore Papers — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/explore-papers\"},{\"title\":\"Awards — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/awards\"},{\"title\":\"Demonstrations — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/demonstrations\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Registration — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/registration\"},{\"title\":\"Can Small and Reasoning Large Language Models Score Journal Articles for Research Quality and Do Averaging and Few-shot Help?\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.22389\"},{\"title\":\"Speakers — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/speakers\"}]\n\nBased on my search results, I found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page. However, the specific rating scale criteria are not fully displayed in the search results. The guidelines page mentions general review principles such as being constructive and concrete; being courteous and respectful, and that CoRL papers are required to include a limitations section, and reviewers should treat honestly reported limitations kindly and with high appreciation.\n\nThe search results also indicate that obvious shortcomings or flaws not reported by the authors should be pointed out extensively and be strongly reflected in your scores.\n\nUnfortunately, the detailed rating scale criteria themselves (such as specific score values and their definitions) are not included in the search results I obtained. To access the complete rating scale criteria, you would need to visit the full CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page directly at https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"24463d9a-eaaf-4e5b-b633-10caf5e13734","uuid":"f041a3eb-1fff-410b-9e44-e03d3257e953","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:48:09.973Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines rating scale criteria","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_012ozPHqAuyUYn9Un42vgjXD","content":[{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"Call for Papers — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/call-for-papers"},{"title":"Reviewers in 2023","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965321/"},{"title":"Best Reviewers Award for 2023","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10957073/"},{"title":"Reviewers in 2023","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965318/"},{"title":"2023 Reviewer Index","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10791903/"}]},"Based on the search results, I found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page. However, the search result shows general reviewer guidance rather than a specific rating scale. Let me search for more specific information about the rating scale.",{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01AhRtQ11z2oRKdiKTwuCS2k","content":[{"title":"Call for Papers — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/call-for-papers"},{"title":"CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/"},{"title":"Detailed Program — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/detailed-program"},{"title":"Explore Papers — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/explore-papers"},{"title":"Awards — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/awards"},{"title":"Demonstrations — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/demonstrations"},{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"Registration — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/registration"},{"title":"Can Small and Reasoning Large Language Models Score Journal Articles for Research Quality and Do Averaging and Few-shot Help?","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.22389"},{"title":"Speakers — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/speakers"}]},"Based on my search results, I found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page. However, the specific rating scale criteria are not fully displayed in the search results. The guidelines page mentions general review principles such as being constructive and concrete; being courteous and respectful, and that CoRL papers are required to include a limitations section, and reviewers should treat honestly reported limitations kindly and with high appreciation.\n\nThe search results also indicate that obvious shortcomings or flaws not reported by the authors should be pointed out extensively and be strongly reflected in your scores.\n\nUnfortunately, the detailed rating scale criteria themselves (such as